  "description": "download_instruments('NSE') with the cached file in a given state (refresh time 07:00 IST, re-check window 15 minutes). input.now is the clock; file_mtime the cached file's modification time (null: no file); checked the text of the .checked sidecar (null: none); force the argument; responses answer the requests in turn ({status, last_modified}: a 200 carries a new file; {failure: kind}; delete_file removes the cached file before answering). expected.requests lists each request's If-Modified-Since header (null for a full download); file is downloaded or cached and file_mtime its modification time afterwards (a download takes the Last-Modified time), or error is the error type; checked is the sidecar text afterwards (UTC ISO 8601 of now when a check was recorded); warnings counts the WARNING lines (one when a failed re-check keeps the cached file).",
